{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Simple Interval Trainer 是一款為間歇訓練而設的應用程式，適合想按個人節奏完成訓練並保持專注的使用者。使用者可自行編排訓練組合，並透過 Apple Watch 或 iPhone 開始運動；現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-252.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂間歇訓練組合</h2>\n<p>應用程式內置 30 種活動，讓使用者自行建立訓練組合，也可新增自訂活動，組織任何類型的間歇訓練。訓練可從 Apple Watch 或 iPhone 開始，過程以聲音及震動提示，讓使用者無須緊盯螢幕也能掌握節奏，專注完成每組訓練。此外，應用程式無廣告、無訂閱，也不收集資料。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-248-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-249-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-250-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-251-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-252-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-253-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Simple Interval Trainer</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/simple-interval-trainer/id6817101245?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T18:04:19.463694+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T17:52:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T18:37:53.932708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T17:57:44.397490+00:00","content_hash":"7e9e8df2e933b22905f56b21e232f8374ae369f5dec5447462df4acf4fa904fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}